flowchart TD
    User --> UI[Streamlit UI]
    UI --> Python[Python orchestration]
    Python --> API[Alpha Vantage financial API]
    SEC[SEC submissions and 10-K HTML] --> Ingest[Download, extract text, attach metadata]
    Ingest --> S3[Private S3 document bucket]
    Ingest --> Local[Local TF-IDF vector retrieval]
    S3 --> KB[Bedrock Knowledge Base]
    KB --> Embed[Titan Text Embeddings V2]
    Embed --> Vectors[S3 Vectors index]
    Vectors --> KB
    KB --> Context[Company-filtered source passages]
    Local --> Context
    API --> Facts[Python metrics with periods and missing values]
    Facts --> UI
    Facts --> Qualitative[Deterministic qualitative observations]
    Context --> Prompts[Grounded prompts]
    Qualitative --> Prompts
    Prompts --> Bedrock[Nova Lite via Converse]
    Bedrock --> Checks[Citation range and report numeric checks]
    Checks --> UI
